Now I have a good picture. Let me design.

### Main fix: `stop_on_pr_close.ts`

A new machinery script that, given a PR number (and optionally merged flag), reads the PR's thread and, if a run holds it (an open claim), posts a STOP_TAG comment. It gated read-before-write: don't post if a STOP_TAG newer than the claim's created_at already exists.

